   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello AlDiom,<br><br>lavaan gives a hint for the problem:</div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:#c5060b\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>  </span>lavaan NOTE: this may be a symptom that the\r\nmodel is not identified.</span></p><br></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Regarding your Minimum Function Test Statistics / df, which are well above 2, your significant chi-square p-value and your complex model, the model is likely to do not fit well enough. Mabe you have a look at the fit-measures (CFI, TLI) to be sure. Modification indices may guide you to a proper fit, before starting bootstrap.<br><br>Best<br>Stephan<br></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
